# Build context = repo root. Conservative — only exclude things that are
# definitely not on teleport's import graph or are big regenerable artifacts.
# Anything excluded here is invisible inside the builder stage.
#
# Notes:
#   - integrations/ MUST stay in (lib/web/integrations.go imports msteams).
#   - e/ is the empty enterprise submodule; e_imports.go is gated on a tag
#     that's never set, so excluding it is safe.
#   - dev/ is the local-cluster scaffold (compose / pki / kind / bootstrap)
#     and is never referenced from production binaries — excluded wholesale.

.git
.github

# Build outputs (regenerable)
build/
target/

# JS output / deps
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
web/packages/*/dist/
webassets/

# Empty enterprise submodule — never compiled in this fork
e/

# Local dev cluster scaffold (compose, pki, kind, bootstrap scripts)
dev/

# Claude agent scratch space (worktrees, plans, memory)
.claude/

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
*.pid
*.swp
